{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_hub_schedule_hub_schedule", "label": "The hub schedule", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_location": "L1-5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "In REBUILT your alliance HUB stops scoring for part of teleop. The console works out when from the rules and the FMS game data, so the robot does not have to tell it."}, {"id": "docs_hub_schedule_six_segments", "label": "Six teleop segments, Table 6-2", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_location": "L12-22", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Teleop runs 140 s in six segments. The clock counts down, so each segment is named by the time remaining when it ends: transition 2:20-2:10, shifts 1-4 at 25 s each, end game 0:30-0:00."}, {"id": "docs_hub_schedule_alternating_shifts", "label": "Alternating shifts 1-4", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_location": "L24-25", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The alliance that scored more fuel in AUTO is inactive for shift 1, then they alternate. On a tie FMS picks one at random, so the game data always names an alliance."}, {"id": "docs_hub_schedule_game_data_arrives_late", "label": "Game data is empty until after auto", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_location": "L29-35", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "/FMSInfo/GameSpecificMessage is a single character, R or B, naming the alliance whose goal goes inactive first. It is empty until roughly three seconds after auto ends, once fuel scoring has been assessed. That is why the tile says waiting for FMS game data early in a match rather than guessing."}, {"id": "docs_hub_schedule_no_game_data_needed", "label": "Auto, transition and end game need no game data", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_location": "L34-35", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Both hubs are active by rule in those segments, and the tile says so rather than reporting an unknown. The schedule is only genuinely underdetermined during shifts 1-4."}, {"id": "docs_hub_schedule_fmsinfo_carries_no_clock", "label": "/FMSInfo carries no match clock", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_location": "L38-46", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "That table has the control word, the alliance, the event and the game-specific message but no time. Robot code has to publish it with CatalystLog.log(\"Match/TimeLeft\", DriverStation.getMatchTime()). Without it the timer and the hub countdown show dashes rather than inventing a number."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_hub_schedule_six_segments", "target": "readme_teleop_shift_schedule", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_location": "L12-22", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_app_shifts", "target": "docs_hub_schedule_six_segments", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_location": "L12-22", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_hub_schedule_alternating_shifts", "target": "docs_hub_schedule_six_segments", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_location": "L24-25", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_app_inactivefirstalliance", "target": "docs_hub_schedule_alternating_shifts", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_location": "L24-25", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_app_inactivefirstalliance", "target": "docs_hub_schedule_game_data_arrives_late", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_location": "L29-35", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_hub_schedule_game_data_arrives_late", "target": "readme_rule_3_never_invents_a_number", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_location": "L32-35", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_hub_schedule_game_data_arrives_late", "target": "readme_game_specific_message", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_location": "L29-31", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_hub_schedule_no_game_data_needed", "target": "docs_hub_schedule_six_segments", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_location": "L34-35", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_app_shifts", "target": "docs_hub_schedule_no_game_data_needed", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_location": "L34-35", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_hub_schedule_fmsinfo_carries_no_clock", "target": "readme_match_clock_fallback_chain", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_location": "L38-46", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_app_matchtime", "target": "docs_hub_schedule_fmsinfo_carries_no_clock", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_location": "L38-46", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_hub_schedule_fmsinfo_carries_no_clock", "target": "readme_rule_3_never_invents_a_number", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/hub-schedule.md", "source_locati